{"version":2,"sourceHash":"8ba562241517e1e324fbb5326f4ec69210a15b0a6dae5c333b57fe04c2e0c36e","locale":"zh-TW","id":"ep-46","no":"EP.46","tag":"第46話 · 所有天空的日食","title":"所有天空的日食","rev":2,"beats":[{"id":"ep-46:1","s":"n","t":"門後沒有地面。只有落腳處會浮出黑色板塊，腳一抬，板塊就消失。","bg":"gongmang","tone":"dark","bgm":"zeroPoint","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"serious"},"c":{"who":"yun","x":"serious"},"r":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"sfx":"door","scene":{"background":"gongmang","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: gongmang","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"gongmang 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:2","s":"n","t":"沒有上下之分。遠處懸著一輪黑太陽，不放光，反而吸走光。"},{"id":"ep-46:3","s":"yun","t":"空亡。因為空著，什麼都能裝進去的位置。沒想到我掌心裡面長這樣。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:4","s":"moka","t":"一想到在別人手心裡，感覺真怪。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:5","s":"yun","t":"別踩掌紋。感情線斷了，摩卡先生負責。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-46:6","s":"n","t":"沒有人笑出來，因為笑聲一出口，就被吸向黑太陽。"},{"id":"ep-46:7","s":"yeon","t":"連聲音都吃？","x":"fear","im":true,"fx":"suck","sfx":"whoosh","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"gongmang","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: gongmang","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"suck","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"gongmang 배경에서 진행되는 yeon의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:8","s":"pje","t":"什麼都吃，所以不能久留。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:9","s":"n","t":"Yeoni取出口袋裡的備忘本，第一行的字有點淡了。她用指尖沿著那一行又描了一遍。"},{"id":"ep-46:10","s":"sys","t":"[ Neo · 先是貓，後來是人 · 銀髮 · 愛嘮叨 · 襪子 · 站在我這邊 ]"},{"id":"ep-46:11","s":"yeon","t":"剛才聽見門後有聲音吧？說襪子要穿成一對。他就在這裡某處。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:12","s":"pje","t":"那先找人，打架放後面。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-46:13","s":"moka","t":"找著找著就會打起來，一直這樣不是嗎。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-46:14","s":"n","t":"這時腳下搖晃起來。黑色板塊間有什麼墜落，是龐然大物，像樓房那麼大的碎片。","bg":"gongmang","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","sfx":"thud","scene":{"background":"gongmang","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: gongmang","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"gongmang 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:15","s":"n","t":"十二宮所在的星之宮殿倒著墜下，屋頂的星一顆顆熄滅。","bg":"zwPalace","tone":"dark","shot":"impact","sfx":"thud","scene":{"background":"zwPalace","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: zwPalace","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"zwPalace 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:16","s":"n","t":"天文臺飛船拖著破帆滑落，十二宮的天空皺成一張摺疊的地圖。","bg":"skyship","tone":"dark","shot":"impact","sfx":"whoosh","scene":{"background":"skyship","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: skyship","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"skyship 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:17","s":"n","t":"二十七月宿神殿的鐘響了一次，整座神殿隨即向黑太陽傾斜。","bg":"nakshatra","tone":"dark","shot":"impact","sfx":"bell","scene":{"background":"nakshatra","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: nakshatra","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"nakshatra 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:18","s":"n","t":"卡牌迴廊的牌像暴風雪般飛散。最後，海上的五座島縮得像玩具，翻滾著墜下來。","bg":"tarotHall","tone":"dark","shot":"impact","sfx":"page","scene":{"background":"tarotHall","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: tarotHall","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":"moonlight","eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"tarotHall 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:19","s":"moka","t":"那是我們的島！食傷之島！","x":"angry","bg":"gongmang","tone":"dark","shot":"wide","scene":{"background":"gongmang","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: gongmang","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"gongmang 배경에서 진행되는 moka의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-46:20","s":"yun","t":"五片天空全在往這裡崩塌。黑月留著門，等我們進來。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:21","s":"yeon","t":"就因為我們進來，便全毀了？","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:22","s":"yun","t":"不是毀，是吃。全吃完，這裡就只剩一片天，只剩它。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:23","s":"n","t":"閏月指向黑太陽。倒塌的碎片繞著它轉，一塊塊消失。"},{"id":"ep-46:24","s":"n","t":"黑太陽長出了眼睛，不只一隻，每片坍塌的天空各一隻，一共五隻。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"warCommand","shot":"wide","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"fear"},"c":null,"r":{"who":"pje","x":"serious"},"sfx":"glitch","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:25","s":"heuk","t":"來吧，我等著呢，容器。","im":true,"fx":"reveal","sfx":"glitch","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"reveal","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:26","s":"n","t":"太陽周圍浮起一些名字，都是Yeoni在路上聽過的。黑色化忌，黑月莉莉絲，羅睺的頭與計都的尾，倒塌的高塔。"},{"id":"ep-46:27","s":"yun","t":"全是同一個傢伙，只是在不同天空換了名字。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:28","s":"heuk","t":"名字越多越好，每吃一次，就多一個。"},{"id":"ep-46:29","s":"n","t":"太陽下伸出數百隻黑手，每根手指都掛著某個人的名牌。"},{"id":"ep-46:30","s":"pje","t":"把那些名字還回去，沒有一個屬於你。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:31","s":"heuk","t":"雨水，妳總叫我歸還別人的東西，自己的卻一次也沒守住。"},{"id":"ep-46:32","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨攥緊傘柄，沒有回答，只向前邁了一步，來到Yeoni前面。"},{"id":"ep-46:33","s":"heuk","t":"動手之前，先做交易吧。我很公平，這道理也是我教給那個記帳的孩子的。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-46:34","s":"n","t":"一隻黑手降到摩卡面前，掌中展開一個小舞臺。正午太陽懸著，觀眾坐得滿滿的。"},{"id":"ep-46:35","s":"heuk","t":"火種，我把你島上的歌全還給你，連掌聲一起。但你得在這裡放手。"},{"id":"ep-46:36","s":"moka","t":"我們島的歌，是我們自己唱回來的，不是你給的。","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:37","s":"n","t":"摩卡用手背揮開舞臺。小小的舞臺化作灰燼散去。"},{"id":"ep-46:38","s":"moka","t":"而且掌聲不是借來的，是贏來的。連區別都不懂，就別演出。","x":"base"},{"id":"ep-46:39","s":"heuk","t":"算命的，你不想回家嗎？把時辰還給你，卯時，名字也還你。"},{"id":"ep-46:40","s":"n","t":"掌上浮起一隻鐘，指針在五點二十分附近顫抖。閏月的目光無法從指針上挪開。"},{"id":"ep-46:41","s":"yun","t":"那個，是真的？","x":"void","im":true,"shot":"close","sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:42","s":"yeon","t":"閏月先生。","x":"fear"},{"id":"ep-46:43","s":"n","t":"閏月伸出手，指尖幾乎碰到鐘時，又停住了。戴著手套的手指在空中發抖。"},{"id":"ep-46:44","s":"yun","t":"真的也不要。拿了它，我就能回家，可Yeoni會留在這裡。","x":"sad"},{"id":"ep-46:45","s":"yun","t":"而且我的時辰，是我靠生時校正找回來的，沒有理由向你領。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-46:46","s":"n","t":"黑手來到徐寒雨面前。掌上是下雨的車站，第一個春天的車站，長椅上放著信封。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"rain","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:47","s":"heuk","t":"雨水，我讓妳回去，回到那天那個車站。這次我不插手。那孩子、信封、大海，全是妳的。"},{"id":"ep-46:48","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨屏住呼吸。車站的雨聲太真實，信封上的字也看得見：一起去海邊。"},{"id":"ep-46:49","s":"pje","t":"回到那個春天。","x":"waver","im":true,"fx":"water","sfx":"water","shot":"close","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"water","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 pje의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:50","s":"yeon","t":"寒雨。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:51","s":"n","t":"Yeoni只叫了她的名字，不勸阻，也不拉住她，讓她自己選。"},{"id":"ep-46:52","s":"pje","t":"回到那個春天，這個春天Yeoni給我的傘就會消失，那把纏了三層膠帶的傘。","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-46:53","s":"pje","t":"不去。我要在這個春天償還。","x":"resolve"},{"id":"ep-46:54","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨用手蓋住車站，安靜地，像放下攥了很久的東西。小小的車站化成雨水流走。"},{"id":"ep-46:55","s":"heuk","t":"一個比一個無趣。那就直接問容器吧。","bg":"eclipseSky","tone":"dark","bgm":"crisis","shot":"impact","sfx":"glitch","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"steady"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 heuk의 대사"}},{"id":"ep-46:56","s":"n","t":"最後一隻手在Yeoni面前攤開。Neo蜷縮在掌心，閉眼的身體像玻璃般模糊，看不出是否還在呼吸。"},{"id":"ep-46:57","s":"heuk","t":"就是妳忘掉的那個，連名字也記不起吧？騰空自己，我就還妳。妳成為容器，他也能一起待在裡面，永遠。"},{"id":"ep-46:58","s":"n","t":"Yeoni看著那張臉，名字與記憶都浮不上來，只有手掌熱了。"},{"id":"ep-46:59","s":"n","t":"金光從Yeoni左手漏出，那是塔下緊握的金線滲入之處。光伸向黑手，又聚回掌心。","im":true,"fx":"metal","sfx":"chime","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"eclipseSky","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: eclipseSky","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"metal","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"eclipseSky 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:60","s":"heuk","t":"啊。"},{"id":"ep-46:61","s":"yeon","t":"這是什麼？手怎麼這麼熱？","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-46:62","s":"n","t":"黑月的聲音第一次動搖，五隻眼睛同時望向Yeoni掌心。"},{"id":"ep-46:63","s":"heuk","t":"原來在那兒，我沒吃完的碎片。"},{"id":"ep-46:64","s":"n","t":"數百隻黑手一起撲來，朝著Yeoni，準確說，是她的左手。","bg":"handsRush","tone":"dark","bgm":"warDream","shot":"impact","l":{"who":"yeon","x":"fear"},"c":{"who":"pje","x":"angry"},"r":{"who":"moka","x":"angry"},"sfx":"slash","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"crossfade","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"drift"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:65","s":"pje","t":"Yeoni，退後！","x":"angry","im":true,"fx":"shake","sfx":"thud","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"shake","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 pje의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:66","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨撐開傘，傘下傾瀉雨水。雨立成一道牆，擋住黑手。手指每碰到雨，就有一個名牌掉下來。"},{"id":"ep-46:67","s":"moka","t":"沒有火柴也行，我的火本來就從嘴裡出來！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:68","s":"n","t":"摩卡深吸一口氣，喊了出來，是饒舌。節奏與歌詞都亂七八糟，可聲音裡依然迸出火花，幾隻手被燒得縮回去。"},{"id":"ep-46:69","s":"yun","t":"我來吞，稍微讓開一點。","x":"pain"},{"id":"ep-46:70","s":"n","t":"閏月摘掉手套，伸出手掌。黑手被吸過去，他的臉瞬間慘白。空亡的圓擴散到了手腕。"},{"id":"ep-46:71","s":"yeon","t":"停下！手上的東西越來越大了！","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-46:72","s":"yun","t":"這隻手本來就是留著這種時候用的。","x":"laugh"},{"id":"ep-46:73","s":"n","t":"可黑手無窮無盡。雨牆逐漸變薄，摩卡的聲音沙啞破裂，閏月膝蓋一軟。","bg":"handsRush","tone":"dark","shot":"close","sfx":"heartbeat","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 서술"}},{"id":"ep-46:74","s":"heuk","t":"何必抵抗，交出一個容器，一切就結束了。"},{"id":"ep-46:75","s":"n","t":"Yeoni把漏著金光的左手抱在胸前。連這個也交出去，就沒有路回到那個人身邊了。不知緣由，卻唯獨這一點，她知道。"},{"id":"ep-46:76","s":"yeon","t":"閏月先生，這個，這道光，是什麼？","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:77","s":"yun","t":"是庚，貓先生的金。妳這隻容器裡，還留著一片。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:78","s":"yun","t":"妳的命式原本就五氣俱全，木、火、土、水，還有那道金。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:79","s":"n","t":"閏月依次指向徐寒雨、摩卡、自己，還有Yeoni。"},{"id":"ep-46:80","s":"yun","t":"恰好，這裡五種都在。火、土、水、木，金在Yeoni手裡。","x":"sly","im":true,"fx":"stars","sfx":"sparkle","shot":"impact","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":"stars","camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 yun의 대사"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:81","s":"yeon","t":"把五氣聚在一起的話……","x":"surprise"},{"id":"ep-46:82","s":"yun","t":"日食由日月重疊而成。五氣運行一周，就能解開重疊。大概。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:83","s":"moka","t":"怎麼這麼多大概！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:84","s":"n","t":"就在此時，雨牆裂開，一隻黑手鑽過縫隙。它抓的不是Yeoni，而是徐寒雨的右腕，曾留著環形傷疤的位置。"},{"id":"ep-46:85","s":"heuk","t":"那就先吃水。五個少一個，就什麼也轉不起來。"},{"id":"ep-46:86","s":"n","t":"徐寒雨被拖向黑太陽，雨傘脫手。纏著膠帶的傘柄在黑板塊上骨碌碌滾動。","im":true,"shot":"impact","sfx":"none","scene":{"background":"handsRush","backgroundMeaning":"작가 지정 배경: handsRush","transition":"hold","tone":"dark","ambient":null,"eventEffect":null,"camera":"focus"},"a11y":{"description":"handsRush 배경에서 진행되는 서술"},"pacing":{"pauseMs":700,"importance":"impact"}},{"id":"ep-46:87","s":"yeon","t":"寒雨！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:88","s":"n","t":"Yeoni沒有思考，撿起滾來的傘就跑。漏著金光的左手抓住傘，右手抓住徐寒雨另一隻手。"},{"id":"ep-46:89","s":"pje","t":"鬆手！妳也會被拖走！","x":"cry"},{"id":"ep-46:90","s":"yeon","t":"不鬆。剛才妳選了我，這次換我選。","x":"serious"},{"id":"ep-46:91","s":"n","t":"兩人連成一團被拖去。摩卡抓住Yeoni的書包帶，閏月抱住摩卡的腰。四個人連成一串懸著，黑太陽越來越近。"},{"id":"ep-46:92","s":"moka","t":"這算什麼拔河！我們這隊也太弱了！","x":"angry"},{"id":"ep-46:93","s":"yun","t":"拔河本來就要最後一鼓作氣。還不是時候。","x":"sly"},{"id":"ep-46:94","s":"n","t":"這時Yeoni左手的金光再次散開，沿著傘柄、徐寒雨的手腕流去。黑手指碰到光，猛地一縮，稍稍鬆開。"},{"id":"ep-46:95","s":"heuk","t":"把那道光交出來，那本來就是我的。"},{"id":"ep-46:96","s":"yeon","t":"少來，我備忘上寫了，站在我這邊。我的同伴，不是你的東西。","x":"angry"}]}
